<lhtml version=1>
<head>
  <title>Layout Row Test</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Focused row and block layout example">
</head>

<body>
  <block>
    Full width block before rows. It should wrap inside the available page width and leave enough room around the text.
  </block>

  <spacer height=12>

  <row id="top-row">
    <block width=160>Left column with wrapped text inside a fixed width block.</block>
    <spacer width=12>
    <block width=220>Middle column. It is wider and should need fewer line breaks.</block>
    <spacer width=12>
    <block width=160>Right column.</block>
  </row>

  <spacer height=16>

  <row id="button-row">
    <block width=96>Back</block>
    <spacer width=8>
    <block width=128>Continue</block>
    <spacer width=8>
    <block width=96>Cancel</block>
  </row>

  <spacer height=16>

  <block width=240>
    Narrow block forces wrapping and gives the renderer a useful text measurement test.
    <p>
    The next pass should replace this debug font with a real font interface.
  </block>
</body>
</lhtml>
